{"id":403,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"少人数で個性を伸ばす武相中学校","feature_description":"武相中学校は、少人数教育で一人ひとりのペースを尊重しながら、基礎学力と自己肯定感を育てる学校です。中学3年間は高校生と共に部活動に取り組めるため、技量だけでなく交流の幅も広がります。縦割りの学びや集団行動を通じて、協力し合う姿勢も養い、安心して高校進学へつなげます。高校進学への接続も見据えやすいです。中高で学び合える点も魅力です。","clubs":[{"id":7630,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7631,"name":"硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7632,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7633,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7634,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7635,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7636,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7637,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7638,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7639,"name":"スケート部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7640,"name":"フットサル部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7641,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7642,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buso.ac.jp/pdf/BUSOJH2012.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7643,"name":"陸上競技部","c